				 </div>=20
				 <div class=3D"dsm-faq-item-inner-wrapper">
				   <div class=3D"dsm_open_icon"><span>2</span></div>
				   <div class=3D"dsm_close_icon"><span>3</span></div>
				  =20
				  =20
				 </div>
				</div>
				<div class=3D"dsm-faq-content" style=3D"display: none;">
<p><span>As of July 1st, 2023 TCM Academy transitioned to a monthly subscri=
ption model, where you now receive full access to all of the courses on our=
 platform for as long as your subscription remains active.</span></p>
</div>
